out god "\n\rDecimus's slash scratches the pet dragon.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe pet dragon's slice misses Decimus.\n\rDecimus's slash misses the pet dragon.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe pet dragon's slice grazes Decimus.\n\rDecimus is burned by a small sword.\n\rA small sword freezes Decimus.\n\rDecimus is struck by lightning from a small sword.\n\rDecimus's slash scratches the pet dragon.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe pet dragon's slice grazes Decimus.\n\rDecimus is burned by a small sword.\n\rA pink potion bubbles and boils!\n\rA small sword freezes Decimus.\n\rDecimus is struck by lightning from a small sword.\n\rDecimus is stunned, but will probably recover.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe pet dragon's slice grazes Decimus.\n\rDecimus is mortally wounded, and will die soon, if not aided.\n\rDecimus is burned by a small sword.\n\rDecimus is mortally wounded, and will die soon, if not aided.\n\rA small sword freezes Decimus.\n\rDecimus is mortally wounded, and will die soon, if not aided.\n\rDecimus is struck by lightning from a small sword.\n\rDecimus is DEAD!!\n\rDecimus's heart is torn from his chest.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9"
out dec "\n\rYou block the pet dragon's attack with your shield.\n\rYour slash scratches the pet dragon.\n\rThe pet dragon has a few scratches. \n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe pet dragon's slice misses you.\n\rYour slash misses the pet dragon.\n\rThe pet dragon has a few scratches. \n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe pet dragon's slice grazes you.\n\rA small sword sears your flesh.\n\rThe cold touch of a small sword surrounds you with ice.\n\rYou are shocked by a small sword.\n\rYour slash scratches the pet dragon.\n\rThe pet dragon has a few scratches. \n\r\n\r<14hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe pet dragon's slice grazes you.\n\rA small sword sears your flesh.\n\rA pink potion bubbles and boils!\n\rYou sure are BLEEDING!\n\rThe cold touch of a small sword surrounds you with ice.\n\rYou sure are BLEEDING!\n\rYou are shocked by a small sword.\n\rYou are stunned, but will probably recover.\n\r\n\r<-1hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rYou are mortally wounded, and will die soon, if not aided.\n\rYou are mortally wounded, and will die soon, if not aided.\n\rYou are mortally wounded, and will die soon, if not aided.\n\rYou have been KILLED!!\n\r\n\r\n\r<1hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9"
